{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>YHWH.</b> The sense of ואתם: \"How do you judge my people, and you have burned the vineyard?\" like רעיתם, like ובער בשדה אחר (Exodus 22:4). And the vineyard is Israel."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:08.273983796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}